        "original_id": "f6aebe8f-8a4a-5a9b-a66c-5e433ec9f330",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tina Turner, Ike Turner, Angela Bassett, Laurence Fishburne, Brian Gibson\n- Works: What's Love Got to Do with It, Ike & Tina Turner Revue\n- Topics: Biographical films, rock and roll\n\nFacts:\n- Ike Turner was an early pioneer of 1950s rock and roll.\n- Ike Turner is most popularly known for his work with his then-wife Tina Turner in the Ike & Tina Turner Revue during the 1960s and 1970s.\n- What's Love Got to Do with It is a 1993 American biographical film directed by Brian Gibson.\n- What's Love Got to Do with It is loosely based on the life of Tina Turner.\n- What's Love Got to Do with It stars Angela Bassett as Tina Turner and Laurence Fishburne as Ike Turner.",
